WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.480
Recovery protects
the underlying business process.

00:00:02.720 --> 00:00:05.360
A severe regression,
outage or policy event

00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:08.480
can trigger containment
and stop consequential actions.

00:00:08.613 --> 00:00:13.520
Route work to an approved fallback
or human queue while preserving evidence.

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:18.720
Diagnose and rerun the failing cases
before an owner authorizes resumption.

00:00:18.880 --> 00:00:22.160
Reverting a model does not
undo an external side effect.

00:00:22.252 --> 00:00:27.040
Compensation and reconciliation
therefore need their own tested runbooks.
